[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808967455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2808967455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2808967455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nbXEf","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T09:29:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T09:29:15Z","body":"The hint does not work correctly if you use a Resource type as hint:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ad8c057-4870-4fcb-b716-f13bd158fd96)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808967455/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819782085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2819782085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2819782085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oEnXF","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T00:42:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T00:42:14Z","body":"It should be fixed; I didn't copy some code from the dictionary editor. I also updated the docs so the `ARRAY_TYPE` and `DICTIONARY_TYPE` hints are preferred for typed arrays/dictionaries (just for clarity). In the end though, for the inspector at least, the only thing that matters is the hint string, so the `PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY_TYPE` and related are just for clarity.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2819782085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820562712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2820562712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2820562712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oHl8Y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T08:27:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T08:27:29Z","body":"Works correctly now, but it effectively makes `PROPERTY_HINT_TYPE_STRING` and `PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY/DICTIONARY_TYPE` be equivalents 🤔 You can use either syntax with both of them, to the point that you do `@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY_TYPE, \"int;NodePath\") var am_dict: Dictionary` and the Dictionary has the specified type.\r\n\r\nI also discovered that we have some wrong usages of `PROPERTY_HINT_ARRAY`. We have some properties using the \"new\" syntax (i.e. plain type name instead of `MAKE_RESOURCE_TYPE_HINT`), which isn't supported. It only works, because the getter returns TypedArray.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820562712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820569160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2820569160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2820569160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oHnhI","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T08:30:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T08:33:13Z","body":"In the current master, I don't believe the property hint matters at all either, it was just choice/convention/clarity (for the inspector at least). The types displayed in the docs are generated using the return values of the getter functions, so it doesn't use the property hint. This PR adds support for the plaintext version, which I suppose is where the issue comes from.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820569160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2838046059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2838046059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2838046059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pKSVr","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T09:14:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T09:14:16Z","body":"Ideally they should be phased out to use one of these property hints. We could deprecate the rest after this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2838046059/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2839524313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105368#issuecomment-2839524313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105368","id":2839524313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pP7PZ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id"